  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: ForceItOut
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _description: 'the player wants the answer and she wants it NOW. she demands that
    jessi tell her if she really wants any of her help. there''s nothing more helpful
    than learning the life someone has lived thus far.


    jessi refuses, telling
    the player to drop it, but the player continues to egg on. frustrated, jessi
    angrily explains how she was forced into being a social recluse by her shitty
    parents because of her shitty brother that got kidnapped by shitty people and
    god it''s all so fucking shit. there are you fucking happy i said it


    the
    player notices that jessi''s eyes start to water, but can''t feel any remorse
    for her. all she comments is that she''s got some useful information now. she
    just wishes jessi would get herself together because it''s difficult to make
    a deal with someone seconds away from bursting into tears.


    didn''t it feel
    so good to let that out, asks the player. isn''t jessi so thankful that the player
    had encouraged her to be so vulnerable? jessi blinks away her tears, admitting
    that it did feel good. she had yet to tell anyone because of her fear of rejection,
    but it feels so so SO good to finally admit how shitty her life is.


    it
    seems that jessi is in a better mood about now. perfect. time to go in for the
    kill.'
  _sameOptionTarget: 3
